{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgke9L3m6xzfP4mxcUbSE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I've gone through the table as far as I would on my phone, plus the very bottom. Here's my answer and what happened along the way.\n\n**What I'd do:** I'd go with Harel (הראל), the \"עוקב מדד S&P 500\" track. I'm fairly sure. What decided it: I came for \"the S&P\" and Harel is a name I know from ads. Its row is \"0.56% מהחיסכון\", \"0% מההפקדה\", \"13.7%\" for 3 years and \"11.92%\" for 5, with \"2.3 מיליארד ₪\" in it. Nothing in that row scared me.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n- **Top:** the heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\". \"קופת גמל להשקעה 143\" was already picked, so I didn't touch anything.\n- **The table:** the first block is Harel (\"16 מסלולים\"). I scrolled and looked only at the track names and the big green return numbers. I stopped on every S&P 500 row. Mor's was \"0.71%\", which looked higher. Another S&P one was \"0.56%\", \"13.44%\".\n- **Analyst (אנליסט):** \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" with \"26.39%\" almost pulled me in. But I don't know what \"גמיש\" means, and Analyst is less of a name to me than Harel.\n- **Meitav (מיטב):** its block had more S&P rows with \"13.87%\" and \"12.33%\". They look about the same as Harel's.\n- **Then I quit scrolling:** by screen 7 or 8 I'd lost track of which company each row belonged to. The company name only shows in the grey bar at the start of each block, and after that it's gone. I jumped to the bottom. The S&P row there was marked \"חדש\" with \"עוד לא דווח\", so I passed on it.\n\n**What I skipped:** the \"מה זה קופת גמל להשקעה\" link, the search box, the little \"?\" icons, the small text at the bottom and the \"חוקים וכללים\" link. I didn't open any row.\n\n**What I didn't understand:**\n- \"מט\"ח\" next to the percentages.\n- The two fees: \"מהחיסכון\" and \"מההפקדה\". I took the first one as the real fee.\n- The coloured rings. My guess: more yellow means more abroad.\n- Whether \"3 שנים\" is per year or the total. I took it as per year.\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", \"עוד לא דווח\" and \"הלכה יהודית\".\n\n**What I'd change:**\n- Put the company name on every row.\n- Show the fee in shekels on my amount, so I can see what it actually costs me.\n- Have fewer rows, or tell me which ones to look at. 143 is too many on a phone."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3751,"cache_read_input_tokens":17431,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3751},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e1d145a5-4018-4745-a8bc-f8e734549436","uuid":"5c18e1b8-2026-4ba6-ba15-22e4fc558a7d","timestamp":"2026-11-05T23:22:42.803Z","request_id":"req_011Cgke9KrMcTX2KpZvaeQiC"}
